{"title":"Under the map.","slug":"Under_the_map.","hero":null,"pageid":3416,"revid":18401,"timestamp":"2025-06-18T02:08:10Z","lastEditor":"Imtypingherebecausethenamelimitishigh","categories":[],"infobox":null,"sections":[],"body":"<p><big><b>How to get under the map</b></big>\n</p><p>to get under the map either it can happen by a spawn bug or it can happen from the owner of a property leaving while someone is in their basement \n</p>\n<h3 id=\"under-map-textures\">Under-map textures</h3>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Under the map normally\">Under the map normally</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>Under the map normally</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Under the map near magma cave\">Under the map near magma cave</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>Under the map near magma cave</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Under the map sky? (dont ask why is there a sky under the map)\">Under the map sky? (dont ask why is there a sky under the map)</span> \t \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p><s>Under the map sky? (dont ask why is there a sky under the map)</s></p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>Under the map is a floor that has the default sand texture usually, and the skybox and music will still change depending on what area you are in.\n</p>\n<figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Red fish under map\">Red fish under map</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: Red fish under map\">Red fish under map</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>Red fish under map</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure><p><big><b>Magma cave</b></big>\n</p><figure typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"> \t<span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: The small slot of ground under magma cave\">The small slot of ground under magma cave</span> \t<noscript><span role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Media not yet archived: The small slot of ground under magma cave\">The small slot of ground under magma cave</span></noscript> \t<figcaption> \t\t \t\t\t<span data-unresolved=\"1\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></span> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p>The small slot of ground under magma cave</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p><s>its hard to find a area under magma cave that actually has ground but a small area has been found the image is below this text</s>\n</p><p>you can go under the map in the magma caves by jumping into the lava in some areas of the cave or going into the lava waterfall in the middle of the raffina caldera shop.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"emberbane-cave-ruins\">Emberbane cave/ruins</h3>\n<p>Another way to get under the map is to get to the <a href=\"__BASE__/wiki/Emberbane/\">emberbane ruins</a> and get in the hole under the entrance after you bomb it.\n</p>"}
